{"id":"n22865-1-9","stage":4,"title":"감회 · 感怀","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22865-1-9-1","ko":"우리가 어렸을 때 자주 먹던 과자네요?","zh":"这是我们小时候经常吃的零食吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어렸을","meaning":"年轻","explanation":"어리다：年轻；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹던","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과자네요?","meaning":"饼干","explanation":"과자：饼干；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"과자","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18286","senseId":"1","lemma":"과자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年轻","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["자주"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"8cbae77b051c729e","term":"과자","zh":"饼干","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3","entryId":"18286","definition":"把牛奶、白糖等放入面粉或米粉中搅拌后烤制或油炸而成的零食。","pronunciation":["과자"]}],"audio":"/audio/7886b6d1fdb2196ec54b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n22865-1-9-2","ko":"네, 이 과자를 보니 감회가 새롭네요.","zh":"是的，一看到这种零食，感觉特别有感触呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과자를","meaning":"饼干","explanation":"과자：饼干；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"과자","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18286","senseId":"1","lemma":"과자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감회가","meaning":"感怀，感触，感慨","explanation":"감회：感怀，感触，感慨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감회","audio":"/audio/00b29cb8dabc1606f35b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22865","senseId":"1","lemma":"감회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새롭네요.","meaning":"清晰，新鲜","explanation":"새롭다：清晰，新鲜；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"새롭다","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29029","senseId":"2","lemma":"새롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"8cbae77b051c729e","term":"과자","zh":"饼干","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3","entryId":"18286","definition":"把牛奶、白糖等放入面粉或米粉中搅拌后烤制或油炸而成的零食。","pronunciation":["과자"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"00b29cb8dabc1606","term":"감회","zh":"感怀，感触，感慨","audio":"/audio/00b29cb8dabc1606f35b.mp3","entryId":"22865","definition":"内心产生的对往事的想法或感觉。","pronunciation":["감ː회","감ː훼"]},{"id":"0dd73a3ec7854899","term":"새롭다","zh":"清晰，新鲜","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3","entryId":"29029","definition":"与以前不同，更加新而生动。","pronunciation":["새롭따"]}],"audio":"/audio/81bac3a3f2a2f3bc9dea.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.675,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=22865","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":131,"sequenceScore":2.5017,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这是我们小时候经常吃的零食吧？","是的，一看到这种零食，感觉特别有感触呢。","我决定辞掉那家公司的工，去国外留学了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是我们小时候经常吃的零食吧？","是的，一看到这种零食，感觉特别有感触呢。","我决定辞掉那家公司的工，去国外留学了。"],"answer":1}]}
